//! User-owned portable pre-tool decision type.

/// Portable pre-tool policy result lowered by the generated scaffold.
#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq)]
pub enum Decision {
    /// No objection: the harness's normal permission flow decides.
    ///
    /// This is not an approval. The scaffold lowers it to an empty response
    /// on Claude Code and Codex and to `ask` on Antigravity, which requires a
    /// decision; it never skips the user's permission prompt.
    Allow,
    /// Reject the pending tool call with a harness-facing reason.
    ///
    /// The reason must not be blank: Codex ignores a blank denial.
    Deny(String),
}
